sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Op as Operator / Deployment<br/>(VLLM_PLUGINS, --worker-extension-cls)
    participant API as vLLM API Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP (default)
    participant CP as ServerConfigPlugin
    participant DP as ServerDevicesPlugin
    participant KP as ServerKVCachePlugin
    participant EC as vLLM EngineClient
    participant W as GPU Workers<br/>DeviceInfoWorkerExtension
    participant LLMD as llm-d Scheduler / Router

    Note over Op,W: Flow 1 - Startup initialization (once per server lifetime)
    Op->>API: Start vLLM with VLLM_PLUGINS=llm_d_server_introspection_*
    API->>CP: attach_router(app) + init_state(engine_client, state, args)
    CP->>CP: Read app.state.vllm_config + CLI args<br/>(redact kv_connector_extra_config values)
    CP-->>API: Cache app.state.server_config_response
    API->>DP: attach_router(app) + init_state(...)
    DP->>EC: collective_rpc("get_device_properties")<br/>vLLM internal IPC, no auth (same pod)
    EC->>W: Invoke on every rank
    W->>W: Read current_platform<br/>(NotImplementedError → null)
    W-->>EC: rank, device name, memory, compute capability, compute units
    EC-->>DP: Per-rank device list
    DP-->>API: Cache app.state.server_devices_response
    API->>KP: attach_router(app) + init_state(...)
    KP->>KP: cache_config: num_gpu_blocks × block_size<br/>max_concurrency = tokens / max_model_len
    opt EngineClient.get_kv_cache_group_metadata exists (vllm#48121)
        KP->>EC: get_kv_cache_group_metadata()
        EC-->>KP: Attention-group structure
    end
    KP-->>API: Cache app.state.server_kv_cache_response
    Note over API: Any init_state exception → guarded_init_state<br/>logs and stores None + reason (endpoint returns 503)

    Note over LLMD,API: Flow 2 - llm-d reads introspection data
    LLMD->>API: GET /plugins/llm-d-server-introspection/{config,devices,kv-cache}<br/>8000/TCP HTTP, encryption/auth inherited from vLLM
    API->>API: Route handler reads cached app.state response
    alt Cached response present
        API-->>LLMD: 200 JSON (nullable fields: null = unknown)
    else init failed / no engine / no worker extension
        API-->>LLMD: 503 with reason
    else Never initialized
        API-->>LLMD: 500
    end
